    "recordId": "a87541ac-1cba-4f1a-972d-428dccdbcc0f",
    "slug": "office-renovation",
    "contentType": "service",
    "expectedUpdatedAt": "2026-08-22T06:48:26.731611+00:00",
    "status": "published",
    "baselineFieldsSha256": "a0788f5f36fb9a5458be7b9d57f82e91cd21115a731efe52585b027ef5fe1104",
    "desiredFieldsSha256": "86b6463ea0747f33e45f6a6ea53ea34b5d2e36e60939e0df4c10c585abdb1d19",
    "changedFields": [
      "content_en",
      "content_zh"
    ],
    "desiredFields": {
      "content_en": "<p>For an office fit-out in Kuala Lumpur or Selangor, start with the actual unit and its intended use. Share a floor plan or site photos, approximate area, headcount, visitor flow, the items to retain, access rules and any building-management requirements. These details help separate essential operational work from optional finishes before a quotation is prepared.</p><p>A written scope can then identify the agreed layout, partitions, reception and meeting areas, workstations, storage, lighting, flooring, electrical and data points, selected built-ins and material direction. It should also record owner-supplied items, exclusions, restricted work hours, management submissions and dependencies between trades. Any drawing or document support, responsibility and cost must be confirmed against the actual building requirements and agreed scope.</p><p>New fit-out work and lease handback or reinstatement obligations should be reviewed as separate scopes. If the tenancy has a handback clause, share it for review; reinstatement is included only when the written quotation expressly covers it. Final price, programme and any approval requirements depend on the site review, confirmed work and the property rules. No fixed price, completion date or approval outcome is promised here.</p>",
      "content_zh": "<p>规划吉隆坡或雪兰莪的办公室装修与商业空间 fit-out，先从实际单位和业务用途出发。可准备平面图或现场照片、约略面积、员工人数、访客动线、拟保留项目、进出场限制及大楼管理处要求。这样才能在报价前分清必要工程与可选的装饰升级。</p><p>书面工程范围可逐项确认布局、隔间、接待区与会议室、工作站、收纳、灯光、地面、电力及数据点、局部定制柜和材料方向，并写明业主自备项目、排除项、允许施工时段、管理处提交资料与工种之间的依赖。图纸或文件协助的责任、费用和范围，应按实际大楼要求及双方确认内容厘清。</p><p>新办公室 fit-out 与租约退租复原义务应分开核对；如租约有交还条件，可提供条款供范围讨论，只有书面报价明确列入时才视为包含复原工程。最终价格、工期及审批要求仍取决于现场查看、确认的工程范围和物业规定；本页不承诺固定价格、完工日期或审批结果。</p>"
    },
